---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Guille Sanchez" name="Guille Sanchez" description="Privacy policy for guillesanchez.dev.">
  <section style="max-width:720px;">
    <div class="s-tag"><span></span>Privacy Policy</div>
    <h1 class="s-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="h-desc" style="max-width:none;">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-GB", { year: "numeric", month: "long", day: "numeric" })}</p>

    <p class="h-desc" style="max-width:none; margin-top:24px;">This site is a static personal portfolio. It does not run a server-side backend and does not collect, store, or sell personal data submitted through it.</p>

    <h2 class="status-title" style="margin-top:32px; font-size:20px;">Contact links</h2>
    <p class="h-desc" style="max-width:none;">The email address and social links on this site (GitHub, LinkedIn) open your own mail client or leave this site entirely. Anything you send that way is handled by that service's own privacy policy, not this one.</p>

    <h2 class="status-title" style="margin-top:32px; font-size:20px;">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="h-desc" style="max-width:none;">If analytics are enabled on this site, they are cookieless and collect only aggregate, non-identifying usage data (page views, referrers, device type). No cross-site tracking and no personal profiles are built.</p>

    <h2 class="status-title" style="margin-top:32px; font-size:20px;">Contact</h2>
    <p class="h-desc" style="max-width:none;">Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:guillemeister11@gmail.com" class="cl">guillemeister11@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
